      "text": "six years he shall serve: and in the seventh he shall go out free, Ex. 21:2 (Jer. 34:14). seventh year thou shalt let it rest, Ex. 23:11. shall the land keep a sabbath, Lev. 25:2. What shall we eat the seventh year, Lev. 25:20. keep my sabbaths, Lev. 26:2. shall the land enjoy her sabbaths, Lev. 26:34. every seven years thou shalt make a release, Deut. 15:1. as long as she lay desolate she kept sabbath, 2 Chr. 36:21. we would leave the seventh year, Neh. 10:31. When will the new moon be gone … and the sabbath, that we may set forth wheat, Amos 8:5.",
